  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To The Sand Castle in Seagrove Beach!<br>3 Kings / 2 Sets Twin Bunks Plus Trundle<br>Please No Pets ~ No Parties<br>Pool Heat May Be Added For $50/Day<br><br>“Everyday day is a good day to build a sandcastle!” Pinkie Flamingo was always amazed at all of the many fun beach activities her guests liked to indulge in. As a curator of fine vacation rentals along Florida's Gulf Coast, Pinkie had the pleasure of visiting each and every property and knew an inspirational name when she heard one. “I can see some sand art in our future here!”<br><br>Enviably located in the popular area of Seagrove Beach, a premier destination along Florida's favorite Coastal Hwy 30A, this 4-bedroom classic beach retreat with a private heated pool is right where everyone wants to be. Literally within steps you can be on the beautiful sugar white sands and sparkling turquoise waters of the Emerald Coast. Nearby find 30A institutions like The Olde Florida Fish House, famous for its with idyllic al fresco dining venue overlooking the serene waters of Eastern Lake. Frequently the scene of local live music, The Olde Florida Fish House is where Pinkie first tasted George T Stagg bourbon, “It was a life-changing experience…that's for sure!” Pinkie smiled at the pleasant memory. Another popular neighborhood eatery invites you in for breakfast, lunch and dinner…The Perfect Pig, among the top 10% of restaurants worldwide reviewed on Trip Advisor, serves up local favs like fried green tomatoes with crab meat. Check out Beachy Bean for all sorts of yummy treats or grab some breakfast a Canyon Road at the new market shops of Greenway Station.<br><br>“All of this talk of food is making me hungry!”<br><br>Let's Peek Inside Sand Castle…<br>Cool Coastal Vibe<br>Open Living/Dining/Entertainment Area<br>White, Modern Granite & Stainless Kitchen Fully Equipped For Meal Prep<br>Flatscreen TV's All Bedrooms<br>Dining Table Seats 6<br>Living Area Features Sectional Sofa<br><br>Let's Pop Outside…<br>Private Heated Pool ~ Pool Heat May Be Added for $50/Day<br>Fully Fenced Yard<br>Screen Porch<br>Outdoor Dining Table Seats 8<br>6 Pool Loungers<br>BBQ Grill<br>Winding scenic highway 30A is composed of a diverse array of charming beach communities and quaint eclectic neighborhoods each with its own style and appeal. Seagrove Beach is noted for its central location, excellent local dining options and natural beauty. Garnished with graceful live oaks, stately magnolias and the glimmering reflection off Eastern Lake, recreational opportunities abound here including lake swimming and kayaking. Kayak rentals available lakeside!<br><br>Maybe it's time to stop looking and time to start booking.<br><br>Makin' My Way Along 30A!<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br><br>Must Be 25 To Book<br>No Smoking<br>Cancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>Sheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>All Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>Basic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
